import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="常见问题"><div class="container page-hero"><div class="eyebrow" data-zh="常见问题">FAQ</div><h1 data-zh="你可能想知道这些。">What you may want to know.</h1></div><section class="container legal" style="padding-top:0"><div class="faq-item"><h3 data-zh="免费额度何时领取？">When do I receive free credits?</h3><p data-zh="注册并验证邮箱后，一次性获得 200 次，不按天或月重置，也不主动过期。">After registration and email verification, you receive 200 credits once. They do not reset or expire.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3 data-zh="一次生成三种风格扣几次？">How many credits do three styles use?</h3><p data-zh="一次请求生成自然、幽默、观点三种候选，只扣一次。切换、复制或填入草稿不会再扣。">One request returns natural, playful, and thoughtful drafts and uses one credit. Switching, copying, or filling a draft costs no extra credits.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3 data-zh="需要自己的 DeepSeek Key 吗？">Do I need my own DeepSeek key?</h3><p data-zh="正式使用不需要。AI 由 Reply Copilot 云端服务提供。自带 Key 仅保留给本地开发测试。">No for normal use. Reply Copilot hosts the AI service. A personal key remains only for local development.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3 data-zh="会自动发送 X 回复吗？">Will it post on X?</h3><p data-zh="不会。你检查草稿后决定是否点击发送。">No. You review the draft and decide whether to send it.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3 data-zh="现在可以充值吗？">Can I top up now?</h3><p data-zh="暂时不能。套餐可查看，支付渠道尚未接入；待付款订单不会增加额度。">Not yet. Packages are visible, but payment is not connected. Pending orders add no credits.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3 data-zh="在哪里反馈问题？">How can I send feedback?</h3><p><a href="/feedback" data-zh="使用反馈表单。">Use the feedback form.</a></p></div></section></Base>
